5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,We should prioritize data that reflects actual user satisfaction and utility before deciding on new improvements.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I agree. It is crucial to understand how space is actually utilized and the impact of closures on scheduling.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,A fascinating start. I suspect our previous timelines have been somewhat... optimistic. I'd like to see the actual delivery patterns.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I want to know if the money we plan for actually covers the real costs! Let's look at the market trends.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"While you all chase ghosts of ""satisfaction,"" I'll be looking at who is actually doing the work. Let's be realistic for once.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Victoria, your point about scheduling is valid. Let's ensure we aren't just building things that stay empty.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,Precisely. We often overlook the operational friction caused by construction and the subsequent occupancy rates.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, your enthusiasm for the budget is charming, but the budget is only as good as the schedule it follows.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, but if the price jumps after the contract is signed, the schedule doesn't matter because we'll run out of cash!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,Such passionate bickering. It's almost endearing. I'll stick to the operational reality of the staff.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,Let's move toward our selections. I want to see the actual feedback from those who live with these facilities.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will focus on the post-occupancy data and the timetable records to see the real cost of downtime.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I shall investigate the delivery schedules and the site diaries. I'm curious about the ""weather"" that always seems to delay us.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm going for the tender records and the post-occupancy reviews! I want to see the gap between the bid and the result.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'll take the staffing posts and the bench technicians' routines. Someone has to remember the humans involved in this.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
